@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = PASTE_LOGIN_TOKEN_HERE
@recordId = PASTE_RECORD_ID_HERE

### Register (public; always student)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Demo Student","email":"demo@example.com","password":"CampusDemo123"}

### Login; copy token into @token. Use an admin account for writes.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"demo@example.com","password":"CampusDemo123"}

### Current authenticated user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Events (public read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events

### Create event (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"AI Workshop","description":"Campus AI demo","date":"2026-11-02","time":"10:00 AM - 12:00 PM","location":"Main Auditorium","image":"/images/event1.png","category":"Workshop"}

### Announcements
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/announcements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create announcement (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/announcements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Semester Registration","description":"Register through your faculty office this week.","category":"Academic","date":"2026-10-28","priority":"high"}

### Schedules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create schedule (admin; times use 24-hour HH:mm)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"subject":"Data Structures","date":"2026-11-02","startTime":"08:30","endTime":"10:00","location":"Hall A1","type":"Lecture"}

### Library resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/library
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create resource (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/library
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"MDN Web Docs","type":"Digital resource","description":"Web development reference","availability":"Online","location":"Online","link":"https://developer.mozilla.org/"}

### Campus locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create location (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Computer Lab","building":"Engineering Block","description":"Student computing facilities","category":"Lab","openingHours":"Monday-Friday 08:00-17:00","directions":"First floor, turn right"}

### Chat (repeat with events, announcements, timetable or locations questions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assistant/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"What are the library hours?"}

### Update an announcement (same pattern for events/schedules/library/locations)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/announcements/{{recordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"priority":"urgent"}

### Delete announcement (same pattern for each collection)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/announcements/{{recordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid input: expect 400 when authenticated as admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"subject":"Invalid example"}

### Logout; token becomes invalid
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
